_assets/steam/apps/1612900/extras/b090a2b01dd6a2dfed167c383f939491.mp4?t=1714689250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612900/extras/5ebc1f718fb48e9ce54d58b512e331c0.avif?t=1714689250\" /></div><br><strong>Play with your friend, even if they are far away, with Remote Play Together!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612900/extras/a31ce18a0a845ee79ba1257b2183a64b.avif?t=1714689250\" /></div>",
